  "description": "Hand a conversation to a human: state = operator, LLM summary, client topic in the operator supergroup (created once, created again when it was deleted), card with history and a \"Return to bot\" button. Retried by cron.reconcile until notified_at is set; a card that cannot be posted is one incident, closed when it gets through. A clinic without an operator group or bot keeps the bot: the client gets the clinic phone and the platform chat an alert."
